{"info": {"address1": "6/16/13, Krishnarayapuram Road", "address2": "Ganapathy", "city": "Coimbatore", "zip": "641006", "country": "India", "phone": "91 42 2253 2325", "fax": "91 42 2253 2333", "website": "https://www.lgb.co.in", "industry": "Auto Parts", "industryKey": "auto-parts", "industryDisp": "Auto Parts", "sector": "Consumer Cyclical", "sectorKey": "consumer-cyclical", "sectorDisp": "Consumer Cyclical", "longBusinessSummary": "L.G. Balakrishnan & Bros Limited manufactures and sells chains, sprockets, and metal formed parts for automotive and industrial applications in India and internationally. The company operates through Transmission and Metal Forming segments. It offers transmission products; sprockets and gears; sealed and standard, silent, bush and roller, and special application chains; mechanical, hydraulic, between chain, and compact tensioners, as well as guides; scooter, 4 wheelers and tractors, cogged V, poly V, and timing belts; scooter components, such as clutch weight roller, clutch slider piece, face comp movable drive, 5G tech belts, cushion bush kit, pivot arm set, and starter pinion gear drive; and rubber products, brake shoes, fine blanked components, and precision machined parts. The company also provides metal forming products consisting of fine blanking for precision sheet metal parts, and machined components, as well as wire drawing products for other chain manufacturing plants, spring steel suppliers, and umbrella manufacturers. It markets its products under the Rolon brand. L.G. Balakrishnan & Bros Limited was founded in 1937 and is based in Coimbatore, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Balakrishnan  Vijayakumar", "age": 72, "title": "Executive Chairman", "yearBorn": 1953, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 48586000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Palanisamy  Prabakaran B.E.", "age": 66, "title": "MD & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1959, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 34